 "sess.faq.q.who-can-book": "Session kaun book kar sakta hai?",
 "sess.faq.a.who-can-book": "Schools, colleges, coaching aur IT institutes, companies, housing societies, NGOs, women groups aur doosre community groups email karke book kar sakte hain. Audience kaun hai, age group kya hai aur lagbhag kitne log aayenge, ye bata dena.",
 "sess.faq.q.online-offline": "Agar hum Mumbai mein nahi hain to online book kar sakte hain?",
 "sess.faq.a.online-offline": "Haan. Online sessions India ke kisi bhi sheher se book ho sakte hain, aur bahar se bhi agar time match kare. In-person sessions sirf Mumbai ke andar hote hain. Video platform email pe decide karte hain, jaise Google Meet ya Zoom.",
 "sess.faq.q.fees": "Session ki fees kitni hai?",
 "sess.faq.a.fees": "Request pe share ki jaati hai, audience size aur format ke hisaab se. Neeche wale details email karo, book hone se pehle main clear fee ke saath reply karunga.",
 "sess.faq.q.notice": "Kitne din pehle email karna chahiye?",
 "sess.faq.a.notice": "Jahan ho sake, kam se kam 2 hafte pehle email karo. Agar date urgent hai to bhi likh dena: main jaldi bataunga ki ho sakta hai ya nahi.",
 "sess.faq.q.language": "Session kaunsi language mein ho sakta hai?",
 "sess.faq.a.language": "English, Hindi, Hinglish ya Marathi. Jo language aapki audience ko sabse comfortable ho, wahi choose karo, ya mix bhi chalega.",
 "sess.faq.q.legal": "Kya ye legal advice hai?",
 "sess.faq.a.legal": "Nahi. Session sirf awareness aur education ke liye hai, legal advice nahi. Agar kisi ka paisa gaya ho ya incident report karna ho, to 1930 pe call karein ya cybercrime.gov.in pe report karein.",
 "sess.faq.q.minors": "School children ke liye session ho sakta hai?",
 "sess.faq.a.minors": "Haan, poori session ke dauran ek teacher ya school staff ke saath. Main participants ka personal data nahi leta, aur koi bhi hands-on demo sirf meri apni test devices pe hota hai.",
 "sess.faq.q.recording": "Kya session record hogi?",
 "sess.faq.a.recording": "Sirf tab, jab institute maange, aur attendees ko pehle bata diya jaye. Default mein recording nahi hoti.",
 "sess.faq.q.how-to-book": "Cyber security workshop ya guest lecture kaise book karein?",
 "sess.faq.a.how-to-book": "madhavpandya@zohomail.in pe email karo: institute ka naam, audience, city, preferred dates, aur online chahiye ya Mumbai mein in-person. Main personally plan aur clear fee ke saath reply karta hoon, book hone se pehle. Jahan ho sake, kam se kam 2 hafte pehle likho.",
 "sess.faq.q.college-topics": "Students ke cyber security workshop mein kaunse topics aate hain?",
 "sess.faq.a.college-topics": "College aur coaching students ke liye usual starting point hai UPI fraud, fake job offers, phishing, account takeover, public ya campus Wi-Fi, two-factor authentication, aur digital arrest awareness. School students ke liye session age-appropriate rehti hai: passwords aur PINs, kya share nahi karna, fake game ya study apps, phishing SMS, aur teacher ya parent ko kab batana hai. Batao aapka group kis cheez se worried hai, main session usi ke around shape karunga.",
 "sess.faq.q.online-vs-offline": "Online session aur Mumbai ki offline session mein kya fark hai?",
 "sess.faq.a.online-vs-offline": "Online sessions India ke kisi bhi sheher se book ho sakte hain, aur bahar se bhi agar time match kare. Video platform email pe decide karte hain, jaise Google Meet ya Zoom. Offline, in-person sessions sirf Mumbai ke andar hote hain. Main aapke venue pe aata hoon. Address, room setup, aur projector, microphone aur internet jaise facilities bata dena.",
 "sess.faq.q.clubs": "Kya Rotary, Lions ya student club cyber awareness session book kar sakta hai?",
 "sess.faq.a.clubs": "Haan. Rotary aur Lions chapters, NSS units, student clubs, housing societies, NGOs aur doosre community groups email karke book kar sakte hain. Online poore India mein, ya in person agar venue Mumbai mein hai. Bata dena room mein kaun hoga aur lagbhag kitne log aayenge.",
 "sess.faq.q.school-cost": "School ke cyber safety seminar ki fees kitni hai?",
 "sess.faq.a.school-cost": "Fee request pe share ki jaati hai, audience size, duration, aur session online hai ya Mumbai mein in person, iske hisaab se. Details email karo, book hone se pehle main clear fee ke saath reply karunga. Is site pe koi published rate card nahi hai.",
